Error [jet.PrivateItem]: `argv` is private to its module
  --> jet_runtime_private_member_is_core_only.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     _: proc.argv()
    |             ^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module (`priv(package)`: by its package), and a `priv` field only by its type's module
 Fix: Use `argv` from inside its module, or remove `priv` from its module or field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0605
